{"id":"7f0d78eba77f4a30","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 Turing Functional","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional — ZFC Recursion2 Turing Functional","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional — ZFC Recursion2 Turing Functional","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md]]","[[58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional — ZFC Recursion2 Turing Functional"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" href=\"?note=7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e\\in V\">\\(\\Phi_e\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}\\)</span> 是内部文件 <code>58-df-effective-program-coding</code> 给出的固定编号、有限执行的预言计算关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 为下式定义的预言函数图谓词；其第二参数仍为自然数编号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}turing\\text{-}functional}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;e\\in\\omega\\land\n\\Phi_e=\\{\\langle\\langle X,n\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in(\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\omega)\\times\\omega:\n\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}(m,e,X,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}turing\\text{-}functional}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;e\\in\\omega\\land\n\\Phi_e=\\{\\langle\\langle X,n\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in(\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\omega)\\times\\omega:\n\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}(m,e,X,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原有二元接口保持不变。每次成功执行只进行有限次预言查询；确定性保证函数图单值。</li>\n<li>不再将有限序列三元组直接作为 c.e. 自然数集的成员，也不依赖未编码的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 或未绑定的函数编号。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},